# Metrics/AbcSize Must Be Fixed

When you modify a file that has existing `Metrics/AbcSize` violations, fix them — do not leave them as "pre-existing".

**Never say** "this violation was pre-existing" as justification to skip it. Every file you touch must exit with no `Metrics/AbcSize` offenses.

## How to fix

- Extract complex logic into smaller, focused private methods
- Use guard clauses to reduce nesting
- Split large conditionals into named predicate methods
- Never use `# rubocop:disable Metrics/AbcSize` inline — refactor instead
